      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of ST segment alternans during effort angina is described. This is the seventh such case in the literature. Here the alternans appeared during a ventricular tachycardia. As with the other cases in literature, the alternans took place during an ischemic attack which affected the anterior wall."},
